# No canonical-host or HTTPS rules here on purpose. DreamHost already forces
# HTTPS and redirects the apex to www at the server level:
#
#   http://jamespwright.com/  ->  https://www.jamespwright.com/
#   https://jamespwright.com/ ->  https://www.jamespwright.com/
#
# www.jamespwright.com is canonical. Adding a www -> apex rule here would fight
# DreamHost's apex -> www redirect and produce an infinite loop.

# No auto-generated directory listings. Unlinked routes dropped into the web
# root are reachable by URL but do not advertise their contents. A directory
# that should be browsable opts back in with its own .htaccess containing
# "Options +Indexes" — ebooks/ does this.
Options -Indexes

DirectoryIndex index.html

ErrorDocument 404 /404.html
